      3 
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">مُضَابَحَةٌ</span></b>  The act of <i>mutual reviling,</i> or
<i>vilifying,</i> and <i>encountering,</i> (K, TA,) and <i>contending,</i> or <i>striving, to repel.</i> (TA.)

